    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949000/extras/eb0626278b3f2f5f4a4202fb3f06e4ad.webp?t=1748891440\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949000/extras/9d49a134d56d7109d9c99cea9433dead.poster.avif?t=1748891440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949000/extras/9d49a134d56d7109d9c99cea9433dead.webm?t=1748891440\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949000/extras/9d49a134d56d7109d9c99cea9433dead.mp4?t=1748891440\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>\ud83c\udf38Japanese treats and Catgirls \ud83c\udf38</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Catgirls From My Sweet Dream</strong> - a satirical visual novel with \u201cMatch 3\u201d gameplay in the Magical Japanese Setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf38Welcome to Nekoville \u2013 a small Japanese village located between the majestic and grandiose mountains. Local Catgirls are willing to treat you with traditional Japanese sweets, sushi and sashimi. You will meet cute Nekogirls and help them with their daily tasks, and in return they will help you out even more than you could expect. \u2665</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949000/extras/d99280c230b7b852bdbd926c058670ee.poster.avif?t=1748891440\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1949000/extras/d99280c230b7b852bdbd926c058670ee.webm?t=1748891440\